<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div class="ziyu-reading">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Philosophy</span>

      <h1 class="ziyu-h1">
        Technology should help people become more human, not less.
      </h1>

      <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 28px;">
        Ziyu Development exists to explore how software, hardware, and digital environments can support meaningful human growth instead of endless digital dependency.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);">
      Manifesto
    </span>

    <h2 class="ziyu-display" style="font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 88px);">
      The future does not need louder tools. It needs quieter ones.
    </h2>

    <p style="margin-top: 28px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 18px;">
      Tools that help people focus, reflect, create, learn, and return to real life.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--soft">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 70px;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">What Is Broken</span>

      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">
        Most technology is optimized for attention capture.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-grid-3">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="ziyu-label">01</span>

        <h3 class="ziyu-h3">
          Noise
        </h3>

        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">
          Interfaces are filled with alerts, feeds, nudges, and urgency that make stillness harder.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="ziyu-label">02</span>

        <h3 class="ziyu-h3">
          Extraction
        </h3>

        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">
          Many platforms treat user attention as a resource to harvest instead of a human capacity to protect.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="ziyu-label">03</span>

        <h3 class="ziyu-h3">
          Fragmentation
        </h3>

        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">
          The more tools we use, the more scattered our thoughts, goals, habits, and memories can become.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 70px;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Core Principles</span>

      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">
        What Ziyu is trying to protect.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-timeline">
      <div class="ziyu-timeline-item">
        <span class="ziyu-label">01 Slow Technology</span>

        <div>
          <h3 class="ziyu-h3">Move at a human pace.</h3>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">
            Digital systems should encourage reflection, intentionality, and sustainable attention instead of rapid consumption.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-timeline-item">
        <span class="ziyu-label">02 Human Systems</span>

        <div>
          <h3 class="ziyu-h3">Design around people, not metrics.</h3>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">
            Products should adapt to human needs instead of forcing people into addictive engagement loops.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-timeline-item">
        <span class="ziyu-label">03 Long-Term Thinking</span>

        <div>
          <h3 class="ziyu-h3">Build for years, not impulses.</h3>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">
            The goal is not temporary motivation. The goal is durable systems that support growth across time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-timeline-item">
        <span class="ziyu-label">04 Beauty</span>

        <div>
          <h3 class="ziyu-h3">Make calm feel desirable.</h3>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">
            A calmer digital future should not feel boring. It should feel crafted, elegant, useful, and deeply human.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);">
      The Future
    </span>

    <h2 class="ziyu-h2">
      We are not trying to escape technology. We are trying to make it worthy of our attention.
    </h2>

    <a href="/pages/projects" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--light" style="margin-top: 36px;">
      Explore Projects
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

